OL,3,AWoman says she 'closed eyes and tried
OL,4,Anot to be there' during alleged Russell
OL,5,ABrand rape
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand, 51, has pleaded not guilty to
OL,8,Fall seven charges in the trial - three
OL,9,Fcounts of rape, three charges of sexual
OL,10,Fassault and one of indecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
